---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="404 - Page Not Found" description="페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다" locale="ko" heroPage>
  <section class="relative isolate flex min-h-[calc(100dvh-5rem)] items-center overflow-hidden bg-void px-6 py-24 text-white">
    <div class="absolute -right-24 top-1/4 -z-10 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-accent/20 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-accent">Department of Artificial Intelligence</p>
        <p class="mt-8 text-[clamp(7rem,22vw,15rem)] font-black leading-none tracking-[-0.08em] text-white/10" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
        <h1 class="-mt-10 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300">요청하신 주소가 변경되었거나 존재하지 않습니다. 필요한 페이지로 이동해 주세요.</p>
        <a href="/" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-accent pb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent">
          홈으로 돌아가기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
